<title>USA: Browning-Ferris takes over facility.</title>
<headline>Browning-Ferris takes over facility.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Browning-Ferris Industries Inc said Wednesday that it assumed the lease and related assets of the Delaware County Resource Recovery Facility in Chester, Pa., from Westinghouse Electric Corp.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Browning-Ferris said its affiliate, the privately-held American Ref-Fuel, assumed operations of the plant today with no interruption in service.</p>
